{
    "attributes": {
        "action": "Publish a timetable and approval pathway for supervised self-driving systems.",
        "additional_details": "The Government has published plans for self-driving vehicle pilots and is implementing the Automated Vehicles Act 2024. However, there remains uncertainty around the assessment and approval of supervised self-driving systems that require an attentive human driver.\r\n\r\nWe believe the Government should publish a clear timetable, safety requirements and approval pathway for these systems so that manufacturers, consumers and road users understand how they will be evaluated for use on roads in Great Britain.",
        "background": "Publish a timetable and approval pathway for supervised self-driving systems in GB.",
